<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">călyx</span></b> , ycis,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλυξ [καλύπτω</span>;
		hence, any covering, husk, hull, shell], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the bud</i>, <i>cup</i>, or
				<i>calyx of a flower.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">narcissi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					21, 5, 12, § 25</span></i>
			. rosae, <i><span class="en">id. 21, 4, 10, § 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 18, 73, §
			121</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">papaveris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 18, 76, § 198</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lilii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 5, 11, § 23</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The shell of fruits</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 15,
				23, 25, § 92</span></i>; <i><span class="en">15, 22, 24, §
			86</span></i>; <i><span class="en">23, 4, 43,
				§ 86</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>An egg-shell</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 28, 2,
				4, § 19</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The covering of shell-fish</i>, etc., <i>the shell</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 31, 51, § 100, 9, 56,
				82, § 174</span></i>; <i><span class="en">32, 4, 14, §
			39</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A covering of wax around fruit</i> to preserve it,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				15, 17, 18, § 64</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
